{"hw":"γέμω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">γέμω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">γέμω</span>, used only in <span class=\"lex-gram\">pres.</span> and <span class=\"lex-gram\">impf.</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be full</b>, prop. of a ship, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.118</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.1.21</span> </span>: generally, <span class=\"gk\">πάντα γ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Jul.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Mis.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">368c</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"4\"><span class=\"lex-n\">b</span> = κύειν, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hsch.</span> </span> </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> c. gen. rei, <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be full of</b>, <span class=\"gk\">πλοῖα γέμοντα χρημάτων</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.25</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">λιμὴν ἔγεμεν πλοίων</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Criti.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">117e</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">κώμας πολλῶν καὶ ἀγαθῶν γεμούσας</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">An.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.6.27</span> </span>; of animals, <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be laden.</b> <span class=\"gk\">ὄνοι γέμοντες οἴνου καὶ βρωμάτων</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Posidon.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5</span> </span>: metaph., <span class=\"gk\"